  "why": "A deposit moves both assets from the depositor's trustlines into the pool entry and mints shares onto the pool-share trustline; the asset trustlines carry liquidityPoolUseCount in a v2 extension. Readers that look for the pool's creation here, or drop the trustline extension, misread the pool's first funding.",
